      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Ukraine, Poland, Russia, and across Eastern Europe. Each country has its own version. Ukraine considers it a national dish. The colour and sourness vary by region and by cook -- some versions are crystal clear, others thick with vegetables." }]
